  <h1>About PASI</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Privileged Access Solutions Integration, LLC (PASI) builds secure software for professionals who handle sensitive information. DossierIQ is our flagship product.</p>

  <h2>What we build</h2>
  <p><b>DossierIQ</b> is document intake and organization for elder law and estate firms: a checklist for each matter type, statement coverage month by month for the look-back, and secure, logged sharing. <b>DossierIQ Scan</b> runs on the office PC: it splits a scanned stack into documents, names each one, and files it in the matter's folder in the firm's own Google Drive or SharePoint.</p>

  <h2>Why we built DossierIQ</h2>
  <p>DossierIQ started at a kitchen table. When a parent in our family needed long-term care, we spent months gathering five years of bank statements, tax returns and insurance papers, then gathering them again when something went missing. The attorneys and staff helping us were excellent, and they were buried in the same paper.</p>
  <p>PASI was founded by a technology professional with a background in protecting sensitive information. DossierIQ brings that same care to the files families trust their lawyers with: documents stay in the firm's own storage, every secure share is logged, and nothing is sold.</p>
  <p>If your office spends its days chasing paperwork, we'd like to hear from you.</p>
  <p class="signoff">Founder, PASI</p>

